  "reasoning": "The action concerns a declaration of rights in rem over a warehouse located in Italy. Proceedings whose object is rights in rem in immovable property fall within the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of the Member State where the property is situated. Therefore, the Italian courts have exclusive jurisdiction, and the Spanish court must declare of its own motion that it has no jurisdiction.",
