  "reasoning": "The dispute concerns payment for marketing services. Under Article 7(1)(b), jurisdiction for services lies where the services were or should have been provided. The services were principally performed in Barcelona, so the courts of Spain have special jurisdiction. B is domiciled in Germany, which also provides a general jurisdictional basis under Article 4(1), but this does not displace the special jurisdiction of the Spanish courts.",
